// A guard whose static type is a gradual hole (here: a payload bound from a `dyn` scrutinee)
// passes the static bool check, so its bool-ness is enforced at runtime — the same E0007 an `if`
// condition raises, reported at the guard, identical in both backends (the VM compiles a guard to
// the same fused conditional branch as an `if`/`while` condition).
// expect: error E0007 at 9:16
// expect: exit 1
fn get(): dyn { return some(1); }
echo match get() {
    some(b) if b => "yes",
    _ => "no",
};
